-- Captured mirror-image presets: the appearance the live service answered for each unit.
--
-- Source: the 2026-09-01 capture corpus (mirrorimage_appearances.json): 216 captured
-- 68-byte SMSG_MIRRORIMAGE_DATA bodies across 190 creature entries. Of those, one is the
-- Destiny Weaver 449347 (curated in rev_20260920_00), one is a single observation of entry
-- 164268 whose five customization bytes are all 0x45 (left out as a likely capture artifact)
-- and six are second looks for an (entry, display_id) pair the table cannot hold twice - the
-- more frequently observed body is kept. 208 rows remain.
--
-- Columns are reproduced from the captured packets field for field; item_* columns are
-- item *display* ids, exactly what the packet carries. guild_id is zero in every capture.
--
-- Entries 449340-449357 (the Destiny Weavers) are excluded: their curated looks live in
-- rev_20260919_04 / rev_20260920_00 / rev_20260920_02 / rev_20260920_04 / rev_20260920_05.
--
-- The unit is pointed at the same display by the companion model file, so the packet's
-- display id always equals the display the client holds for the unit.

